  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rajesh Kumar vs State Of U.P. And Anr. on 6 December, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:81554 Court No. - 20 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 5019 of 2016 Applicant :- Rajesh Kumar Opposite Party :- State Of U.P. And Anr. Counsel for Applicant :- Gopesh Tripathi Counsel for Opposite Party :- Govt. Advocate Hon'ble Arvind Singh Sangwan,J. 1. This petition has been filed with the prayer to quash the proceedings of Case No. 924 of 2010 (State vs. Rajesh Kumar) pending in the Court of 1st A.C.J.M. Court No.11, Raebareli arising out of Case Crime No. 112 of 1999 under Section 272/273 of Ipc relating to P.S. Maharajganj, District Raebareli. 2. Counsel for the petitioner submits that a sample was drawn on 25.5.1999 which was sent for verification before the concerned lab which has given adverse report on 3.7.1999.",
    "facts": "This petition has been filed with the prayer to quash the proceedings of Case No. 924 of 2010 (State vs. Rajesh Kumar) pending in the Court of 1st A.C.J.M. Court No.11, Raebareli arising out of Case Crime No. 112 of 1999 under Section 272/273 of Ipc relating to P.S. Maharajganj, District Raebareli. 2. Counsel for the petitioner submits that a sample was drawn on 25.5.1999 which was sent for verification before the concerned lab which has given adverse report on 3.7.1999. Later on, when complaint was filed under Section 7/16 of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, the petitioner exercised his right for re-analyzing the second sample before the Central Food Laboratory, Mysore, wherein, no adulteration was found in the milk sample taken from the petitioner.",
